<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <title>About us</title>
    <link href="/static/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="icon" href="/static/products/Blueprint Logo.png" type="image">
</head>

<body class="bg-[#0b2c4d] text-[#d6ecff] font-mono min-h-screen flex flex-col text-sm lg:text-lg">

    {% include "components/navbar.html.jinja" %}

    <main class="flex-grow text-[#d6ecff]">

        <!-- HERO SECTION -->
        <div class="py-12 lg:py-[90px] px-4 lg:px-[80px] bg-[#0e3a63] border-b-2 border-dashed border-[#6fb7ff]">

            <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-[44px] mb-4 lg:mb-[20px] tracking-[1px]">
                About BluePrint
            </h1>

            <p class="max-w-[700px] text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 lg:mb-10">
                BluePrint gives you clear, step-by-step repair guides powered by
                artificial intelligence — helping you save money and reduce electronic waste.
            </p>

            <p class="max-w-[700px] text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">
               Blueprint is a student led school project and was made for educational purposes only. 
               We do not claim any of either the products or repair guides listed on our website nor do we have the intent of selling any products or services listed on our website Bluprint. 
               All of the information from the repair pages and their relative guides are curated by ifixit and are licensed under Creative Commons BY-NC-SA license. 
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- THE PEOPLE -->
        <div class="py-10 lg:py-[70px] px-4 lg:px-[80px] bg-[#0b2c4d]">

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-6 lg:mb-8 border-b-2 border-dashed border-[#6fb7ff] inline-block pb-1">
                    The Team
                </h2>

                <div>
                    <p class="max-w-[700px] text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        BluePrint is a capstone project developed by a team of three dedicated students: Jason Geban, Caleb Ogboe, and Jayson Ramirez. 
                        Each member contributes a distinct set of skills and perspectives, working collaboratively to design and build an innovative 
                        AI-powered repair guide system.
                        <br><br>
                        
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Team grid -->
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:gap-[50px] mt-8 lg:mt-10">

                <!-- Jason -->
                <div class="w-full lg:w-[300px] bg-[#1a3a5a] p-5 rounded-lg 
                            transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out
                            hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/30">

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jason-geban-jr-b7a475329/"
                       class="block text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold text-[#6fb7ff] mb-2 
                              transition-all duration-300
                              hover:text-white hover:tracking-wide"
                       target="_blank">
                        Jason Geban
                    </a>

                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed text-white 
                              transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-90">
                        Jason is the team leader. His roles are team leadership, sprint planning,
                        and project management.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Caleb -->
                <div class="w-full lg:w-[300px] bg-[#1a3a5a] p-5 rounded-lg 
                            transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out
                            hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/30">

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/caleb-ogboe-48181632a/"
                       class="block text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold text-[#6fb7ff] mb-2 
                              transition-all duration-300
                              hover:text-white hover:tracking-wide"
                       target="_blank">
                        Caleb Ogboe
                    </a>

                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed text-white 
                              transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-90">
                        Caleb is the backend developer. His roles are API development, database management,
                        and server-side logic.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Jayson -->
                <div class="w-full lg:w-[300px] bg-[#1a3a5a] p-5 rounded-lg 
                            transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out
                            hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/30">

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jayson-ram%C3%ADrez-marin-b67a5124a?trk"
                       class="block text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold text-[#6fb7ff] mb-2 
                              transition-all duration-300
                              hover:text-white hover:tracking-wide"
                       target="_blank">
                        Jayson Ramirez
                    </a>

                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed text-white 
                              transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-90">
                        Jayson is the frontend developer. His roles are UI/UX design, responsive design,
                        and client-side functionality.
                    </p>
                </div>

